## Git Workflow

This project uses Git Workflow. Invoke shared skills with `$`, for example `$start`, `$commit`, `$finish`, and `$review`. Configuration and generated state use `.git-workflow/`. Project agents are installed under `.codex/agents/` by `$setup` and synchronized by `$update`.

Routine implementation stays in the main session. Review, release validation/version analysis, and large QA workflows may delegate to the named project agents.

